  "body": "$\\left(2^{\\frac13}+2^{-\\frac23}\\right)^3+\\left(2^{\\frac13}-2^{-\\frac23}\\right)^3$을 간단히 하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "7",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$2^{\\frac13}=A$, $2^{-\\frac23}=B$라 하면\n$$\\left(2^{\\frac13}+2^{-\\frac23}\\right)^3+\\left(2^{\\frac13}-2^{-\\frac23}\\right)^3=(A+B)^3+(A-B)^3$$\n$$=(A^3+3A^2B+3AB^2+B^3)+(A^3-3A^2B+3AB^2-B^3)=2(A^3+3AB^2)$$\n$$=2\\left\\{\\left(2^{\\frac13}\\right)^3+3\\cdot2^{\\frac13}\\cdot\\left(2^{-\\frac23}\\right)^2\\right\\}=2(2+3\\cdot2^{\\frac13-\\frac43})=2\\left(2+\\frac32\\right)=7$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
